server.detail:
New checks:
- the same contest slots for everyone; twins differ in seed but match template/tier/fmt;
- ties share a rank;
- secs excludes the time after the last answer;
- too fast is unranked;
- ghost sittings are unranked with a would_be rank;
- review is 403 before finishing;
- option shares sum to 1 ± 0.01;
- leaderboard sprint counts the best run only;
- near me has you in the middle;
- public=0 hides you from others but not from yourself;
- name uniqueness returns 409;
- private create, join, board;
- carry leaves one ranked sitting;
- rating moves and provisional ends at 30;
- first-contest badge;
- /challenge/ redirects.
